/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52 123 Tm (4. Otherwise scan allow statements in ascending ID order. The first matching) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52 109 Tm (   allow decides.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52 95 Tm (5. If no statement matches, the request is denied by default.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 52 76 Tm (The evaluator compiles selectors into sets/frozensets and memoizes group) Tj
